abstract: >-
  Design-science software artefact comparing blind and aware data-warehouse variants
  built from the same 2017 NHTS source data. The aware variant retains recorded sex,
  source response states and provenance, and governs sex and gender identity as
  separate domains; it records gender identity as not collected because the source
  instrument does not elicit it. The artefact also provides an executable data-quality
  contract, small-cell-suppressed equity measures, an imputation-sensitivity audit,
  and a bounded warm-query benchmark using a containerised InnoDB foil.

